    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλλεύς</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλεύς</span></b> , gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλλέως</span> (either quadrisyll. or
		trisyll., as the metre requires, cf. <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ph.</u>
			4
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			50
		</span></i> with <i><span class="en">
			57
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			364
