		 gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλλῆος,</span>
		etc.:— <u>Achilles.</u>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> the fallacy vulgarly called
				<u>Achilles</u> and the Tortoise', invented by Zeno of
